## corpus/memory/region_net_read_charged.lu
//! check: run(exit=0, stdout="charged true | reclaimed true | got 64000")
//! phase: run
//! conforms: mem.region.account.1, mem.region.account.2, mem.region.create.3
//!
//! s228 (wolf-lang#374, the net half) — `region_str_charged.lu` for the
